257
00:18:25,300 --> 00:18:27,380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Of course, madami po kami naisagawa.

258
00:18:27,380 --> 00:18:37,220
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maliban sa national and local elections, na pinakamabilis po noong 2025 sapagkat nakapagproklamo po kami ng mayor sa gabi ng araw na eleksyon noong May 14.

259
00:18:37,620 --> 00:18:42,040
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kinabukasan, nakapagproklamo po kami ng mga congressmen at gobernador.

