00:18:57,380 --> 00:18:58,660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sa ating kasaysayan.

266
00:18:59,040 --> 00:19:04,880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Magbaga mat hindi po perfecto, ito po yung nagkaroon ng 84.34% voters turnout.

