COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Bago po inabot ng gabi, na proklamo na po kaagad namin yung ating mga nanalo na mga parliamentary districts.

277
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:58,620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Members ng Bangsamoro.

278
00:19:59,060 --> 00:20:04,980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, yan po at the same time ang Inyapong Commission on Election was awarded the Commission of the Year.

279
00:20:06,120 --> 00:20:08,400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: International award po yung aming tinanggap na yun.

280
00:20:08,700 --> 00:20:16,620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Plus all four other awards given by the international body, ICPS, to the Commission on Election.

281
00:20:16,780 --> 00:20:19,820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So kahit paano po, ay malaking accomplishments sa amin.

282
00:20:19,820 --> 00:20:25,780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Including the three consecutive for the first time in the 85-year history of the Comelec.

283
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:32,540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kami po yung nakakuha ng tatlong magkakasunod na unqualified opinion from the Commission on Audit.

284
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:40,860
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, yun naman po ay kahit paano, yung pananalapi, mapagmamalaki namin na inaayos po namin upang kahit paano,

285
00:20:41,300 --> 00:20:47,360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: may pagtitiwala ang tao at masigurado ang proper accountability and transparency.

286
00:20:47,360 --> 00:20:54,180
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kaya lang po, Mr. Chair, kami po yung nag-propose dahil naghahanda po kami ng halalang para sa 2028.

287
00:20:54,660 --> 00:20:55,580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nag-propose po kami.

288
00:20:55,580 --> 00:20:58,520
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Na sana makakapag-print na kami ng balota next year.

289
00:20:58,820 --> 00:21:01,280
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sana makapag-procure na kami ng machine by next year.

290
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:08,840
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi po po pwedeng 2028 ang pag-print ng balota, pag-procure ng machines, at lahat po ng mga gagawin ay hindi pwedeng 2028.

291
00:21:09,220 --> 00:21:12,980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Dapat po lahat siyan, sa karanasan natin, ay a year before the election.

292
