296
00:21:35,220 --> 00:21:35,600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes po.

297
00:21:35,880 --> 00:21:40,520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ibig sabihin, nagpa-participate na po ang mga kababayan natin, mga voters, tumataas na.

298
00:21:40,820 --> 00:21:49,560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Tama po kayo, Mr. Chair. In fact, ang kabataan ng 2025, 45% ng mga kabataan ang bumoto po ng 2025 National and Local Elections.

299
00:21:49,560 --> 00:21:55,000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At kita niyo po, kahit po barangay ng SK Elections, mataas din po ang voters' turnout.

300
00:21:55,580 --> 00:22:04,360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sa dito pong Bangsamoro, after more or less three postponements, nakapagtataka at nakakatuwa po, 84.34%.

301
00:22:04,360 --> 00:22:11,560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maalala ko before, about 70% up lang po. Ngayon, umabot na ng 82%, umabot na ng 84% nung BARM elections.

302
00:22:11,700 --> 00:22:17,860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ibig sabihin, nagpa-participate na po ang mga ating mga kababayan. Sana, tumaas pa lalo ito to 90%.

303
00:22:17,860 --> 00:22:21,800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sana po. Ang isa pong dahilan talaga din po dyan is automation of the election.

304
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:25,340
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And at the same time, siguro po yung malawakang voters'

305
00:22:25,580 --> 00:22:29,580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: education campaign. At tulong na rin po ng iba't ibang civil society organizations.

306
00:22:29,800 --> 00:22:33,000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Meron lang akong gustong i-suggest rin po sa inyo. Pakicheck nyo lang po.

307
00:22:33,500 --> 00:22:38,000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napansin ko, kahit na 82% yung voters' turnout sa national natin,

308
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:48,640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: but sa mga overseas Filipino na voters natin, less than 50% po yung turnout.

309
00:22:48,840 --> 00:22:55,240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, maaaring tingnan nyo na hindi na sila mahirapan or na bumoto or mainganyo silang,

310
00:22:55,580 --> 00:23:04,080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: bumoto, maaaring malayo o nahirapan sila, baka maka ano kayo, makagawa kayo ng bagong sistema

311
00:23:04,080 --> 00:23:07,220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: na mas maging convenient para sa mga overseas Filipino.

312
00:23:07,220 --> 00:23:12,660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair. Kami po ay nagsagawa na sa kauna-unang pagkakataon in our history

313
00:23:12,660 --> 00:23:16,480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ng ating tinatawag na internet voting nito pong 2025.

314
00:23:16,640 --> 00:23:24,580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maaaring po kasing bago at syempre po medyo sinasalat pa ng mga kababayan natin kung paano talaga ito tinitingnan.

315
00:23:25,580 --> 00:23:30,160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi po ganun kataas. Sa isang midterm elections po, Mr. Chair, lagi po siyang mababa.

316
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:38,460
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi pa po siya tumaas ng 20%. Noong nakaraang 2020, kahit po noong 2022, inabot lang po ng 18.3%.

317
00:23:38,460 --> 00:23:44,100
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ito pong 2025, 18.2%. Pero po pagka presidential election, tumataas po siya, Mr. Chair.

318
00:23:44,420 --> 00:23:49,160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Noong 2022 po, presidential election, inabot po siya ng 40.59%.

319
00:23:49,920 --> 00:23:51,500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, less than 50% pa rin po.

320
00:23:51,500 --> 00:23:52,480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes po, Mr. Chair.

321
00:23:52,680 --> 00:23:55,540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Para naman mabigyan sila ng pagkakataon.

322
00:23:55,580 --> 00:23:58,340
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung mga OFWs natin, gustong-gustong bumoto noon.

323
00:23:58,460 --> 00:24:06,760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya lang siguro, maaaring yung oras nila o yung saan sila pupunta o hindi nila alam na meron na tayong online voting.

324
00:24:06,940 --> 00:24:10,320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Baka yung formation campaign nyo po, mas mapaigting pa po.

325
00:24:10,880 --> 00:24:11,520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po.

326
00:24:11,840 --> 00:24:13,020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair.

327
00:24:13,980 --> 00:24:19,200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, kami po, Mr. Chair, ay nabawasan ng 7 billion yung una.

328
00:24:19,600 --> 00:24:23,220
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Tinanggal po namin, zero po kami sa budget para sa aming pinapagawang building.

329
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Zero po kami sa budget para sa mga local.

330
00:24:25,580 --> 00:24:30,840
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Zero po kami sa mga field-integrated offices po namin.

331
00:24:31,280 --> 00:24:33,400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Originally po, 7 billion ang tinanggal sa amin.

332
00:24:33,540 --> 00:24:38,200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pero pagdating po ng NEP, nadagdagan po ito ng 15 point something billion.

333
00:24:38,340 --> 00:24:41,580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, more or less po, 22, 23 billion ang nawala po sa amin.

334
00:24:42,040 --> 00:24:45,400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang problema po namin, doon po sa 15 billion na nawala sa amin,

335
00:24:46,040 --> 00:24:48,820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: okay na po yung tinanggal lang kami sa regular agency budget.

336
00:24:49,380 --> 00:24:50,760
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pwede po kami magtipid ng lahat.

337
00:24:50,760 --> 00:24:55,560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pero we cannot compromise, Mr. Chair, yung automated election natin ng 2028.

338
00:24:55,580 --> 00:24:58,080
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Tinanggal po sa amin, Mr. Chair.

339
00:24:58,560 --> 00:25:04,520
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: For example, tayo po ay magkakailanganin po natin more or less 24,000 machines.

340
00:25:06,640 --> 00:25:10,020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 124,000 machines para sa 2028 elections.

341
00:25:10,740 --> 00:25:14,120
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung kaya lang po, natanggalan po kami more or less ng 1.6 billion.

342
00:25:14,720 --> 00:25:18,220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Question, if you know, how much has the House restored?

343
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:24,320
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi we have not received the GAB, the General [unclear] Bill, yung house version.

344
00:25:24,320 --> 00:25:27,320
Senator Panfilo Lacson: And if you know, nag-restore ba sila sa...

345
00:25:27,860 --> 00:25:28,980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Wala po, Mr. Chair.

346
00:25:29,700 --> 00:25:38,400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: During the budget deliberation po, nakiusap na lang ako sa, kami po sa committee on appropriation, subcommittee on appropriation,

347
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:40,080
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na kung pe pwede.

348
00:25:40,840 --> 00:25:48,620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung yung pong, kasi alam po namin, Mr. Chair, yung 16% na napakaliit na space, budget space po natin,

349
00:25:49,120 --> 00:25:53,580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: mukhang wala naman po kami pagkukuhanan kung saan pa natin kukuhanan yung departamento.

350
00:25:53,580 --> 00:25:58,620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang sabi na lang po namin, kung sakali pong hindi matutuloy ang barangay ng SK elections,

351
00:25:59,140 --> 00:26:06,780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: baka pa pwede pong yung 10.9 billion na unexpended balance, gamitin na lang po namin, ilagay na lang po,

352
00:26:07,120 --> 00:26:10,320
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at kaya po nakakatuwa doon sa BSKE po na ilagay.

353
00:26:10,820 --> 00:26:17,840
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pero ang Congress din po, sa kanila pong special provision, ilalagay din daw po yung provision na yan

354
00:26:17,840 --> 00:26:21,260
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: para daw po makasigurado na may magagamit si Comelec.

355
00:26:23,580 --> 00:26:28,080
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Understood. So you're hoping na ma-postpone?

356
00:26:28,380 --> 00:26:35,820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes po, kaya po, Mr. Chair. Kami naman po, naandito kami, hindi po para pabigatin ang problema pa ng committee

357
00:26:35,820 --> 00:26:42,520
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: kung saan po kukuhanin pa yung sa amin. Yung sa amin lang po is, sana po mailagay na lang din as a special provision

358
00:26:42,520 --> 00:26:46,320
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yung pong nailagay sa barangay ng SK. Malaking tulong na po yun,

359
00:26:46,320 --> 00:26:52,040
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: because maibabalik po namin, Mr. Chair, yung 9 billion, 9.2 billion na nawala kay Comelec

360
00:26:52,040 --> 00:26:53,560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na pang national and local election.

361
00:26:53,580 --> 00:26:59,680
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung natitira pong kulang-kulang na 2 billion, yun na lang po yung gagamitin namin pang-hire ng casual employees,

362
00:27:00,100 --> 00:27:08,540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yung pong sa registration of voters namin, and such other activities na natanggal po sa regular agency budget.

363
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:15,900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang importante po, okay na po yung 11 billion kesa po, kahit po nawala yung buong 15, at least po mayroon kami yung 11 billion.

364
00:27:17,280 --> 00:27:21,820
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kindly update, kasi yung binigay sa aking briefer, yung sa utilization rate,

365
00:27:21,820 --> 00:27:28,740
Senator Panfilo Lacson: well, it is true na 99.9 yung, as of December 31, yung aming data.

366
00:27:28,900 --> 00:27:32,340
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kung meron kayong as of June 30, 2026, kindly update us.

367
00:27:32,840 --> 00:27:33,460
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes, po, Mr. Chair.

368
00:27:33,660 --> 00:27:39,280
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi yung sa, yung na-release talagang nasa 99.9%, no?

369
00:27:39,740 --> 00:27:45,780
Senator Panfilo Lacson: 47.334 billion ang na-release, na iwan lang 32 million eh.

370
00:27:46,280 --> 00:27:51,480
Senator Panfilo Lacson: But of the release amount, 26.4 billion or 55.9%

371
00:27:51,820 --> 00:27:53,800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: lang yung obligated.

372
00:27:54,900 --> 00:28:03,700
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Okay, so yung 20.861 billion, corresponding to 44.1%, yun ang remain unobligated.

373
00:28:04,520 --> 00:28:07,320
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pero yung disbursement rate, again, mataas.

374
00:28:08,160 --> 00:28:08,440
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So,

375
00:28:09,580 --> 00:28:16,820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, Mr. Chair, sa kasalukuyan po, as of September 15, ang aming pong budget utilization ay 38.68%,

376
00:28:17,760 --> 00:28:21,780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sapagkat ito nga po yung sa barangay ng SK, yung part ng period po,

377
00:28:21,820 --> 00:28:25,700
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yeah, I know. Pero yung obligation, yung unobligated, nabawasan na?

378
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:26,480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes.

379
00:28:27,040 --> 00:28:29,220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Naka-factorin yung BSKE?

380
00:28:29,480 --> 00:28:30,140
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes, po, Mr. Chair.

381
00:28:30,140 --> 00:28:31,680
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ah, okay. Thank you. Understood.

382
00:28:36,020 --> 00:28:38,820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, dito po ako para sumuporta sa inyo.

383
00:28:40,080 --> 00:28:46,380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anyway, I would like to congratulate the Comelec, led by Chairperson George Garcia,

384
00:28:46,380 --> 00:28:51,700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sa lahat po na empleyado, sa lahat ng commissioners, ng directors ng Comelec,

385
00:28:51,700 --> 00:28:57,020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: for the successful conduct of the first ever Bangsamoro Parliamentary Elections.

386
00:28:57,560 --> 00:28:59,140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Congratulations po sa inyong lahat.

387
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:04,080
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Anyway, we'll give you time to submit according to the order of priorities,

388
00:29:04,460 --> 00:29:08,640
Senator Panfilo Lacson: kung ano yung gusto nyong ipaugment.

389
00:29:08,740 --> 00:29:15,240
Senator Panfilo Lacson: And let's find out if we can create some fiscal space pagdating nung GAB sa amin.

390
00:29:15,240 --> 00:29:17,020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes, po, Mr. Chair. Maraming maraming salamat.

391
00:29:17,080 --> 00:29:20,240
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ano pa naman? November pa naman siguro yung plenary dito eh, so...

392
00:29:21,700 --> 00:29:24,720
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Okay. So, yeah.

393
00:29:25,260 --> 00:29:29,040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I move to approve the budget of the Commission on Elections.

394
00:29:29,320 --> 00:29:36,240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And I recommend pala to approve the budget and submit it to the plenary for consideration, po.

395
00:29:36,720 --> 00:29:40,900
Senator Panfilo Lacson: There's a motion to recommend to the plenary the budget of the Comelec.

396
00:29:41,520 --> 00:29:46,640
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, hearing no objection, so submitted, approved. Thank you.

397
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:51,140
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair. Senator Bong, maraming maraming salamat po.

398
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:01,220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: [unclear] suspended.

